421
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,200
Surfing.

422
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:20,520
Yeah.

423
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,200
So cool.

424
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:24,920
So nice.

425
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:25,800
