488
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,280
I have.

489
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:41,200
She would be so happy.

490
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,440
So happy.

491
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:43,600
Very fulfilling.

492
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:44,160
Yeah.

493
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,600
