542
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:06,520
There was no need to be like that.

543
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:08,240
But at that moment,

544
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:09,120
I just wanted

545
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:10,400
