579
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,360
I think it actually shows

580
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:07,200
Wentao is really a very cautious person.

581
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,320
He's very cautious.

582
00:20:08,320 --> 00:20:10,600
